<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="eyebrow">BUILD SOMETHING TOGETHER</view><view class="heading-title">与好生意，一起成长</view><view class="subtitle">采购权益、自主定价，连接区域里的更多好店。</view><view wx:if="{{agent&&agent.status==='PENDING'}}" class="card" style="margin-top:35rpx"><view class="result-icon" style="text-align:center">◷</view><view class="result-title">申请已提交</view><view class="result-desc">{{agent.name}} · 等待平台审核</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="demoApprove" disabled="{{busy}}">开发演示：模拟审核通过</button><view class="mock-note">仅用于当前 mock 体验，真实审批在 Web 后台执行。</view></view><view wx:else class="card" style="margin-top:35rpx"><view class="field" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><text class="field-label">{{item.label}}</text><input value="{{form[item.key]}}" data-field="{{item.key}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="请填写{{item.label}}"/></view><view class="note">本期为单级代理采购转售模式，无自动佣金。推广奖励由平台人工登记。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="applyAgent" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">提交代理申请</button></view></block></view>